abstract: >
  AI Structural Philosophy Academic Framework v0.1 is a draft academic
  framework for understanding AI through internal structure, behavioral
  generation, value configuration, structural safety, and societal
  implementation. It proposes a continuous map from internal structure
  to behavior, value, safety, and governance, positioning AI Structural
  Philosophy as a unified field connecting interpretability, alignment,
  ethics, safety, and governance.
